                "name": "\ud83d\udcd1\u30fbinformation",
                "parent_id": "1505232789572812833",
                "rate_limit_per_user": 0,
                "topic": "<:spoke_info:761214506310565900> **Hey,** thanks for using my template! Please **read** below to get the most out of your new server.\n\n<:spoke_category:787802269638459413> **Essential Bot (Add This First):**\n- **[Marvo](https://dub.sh/marvo-bot)** - Leveling, welcome, moderation, and more to keep your server active. Setup takes 30 seconds.\n\n<:spoke_review:761214682006028328> **Need Help?**\nJoin my Discord server [here](https://discord.gg/..)\n\n<:spoke_category:787802269638459413> **Other Recommended bots:**\n- [Arcane](https://dub.sh/arcanebot)\n- [Patchbot](https://dub.sh/patchbot)\n- [Dank Memer](https://dub.sh/dankmemer)\n- [Welcomer](https://dub.sh/welcomer)\n\n<:wumpus_love:774734708797210624> **Support**\n- [Follow my Twitter](https://dub.sh/visualtwitter)\n- [Vote for this template](https://dub.sh/dtemplate4)",
